  "task_prompt": "Starting with a fresh character and world, make as much genuine Terraria progress as possible toward defeating the Wall of Flesh.\nThe window is 1024x1024. Output NORMALIZED coordinates 0..1000 on BOTH axes: left/top=0, right/bottom=1000, center=500,500. Do NOT output pixel coordinates. The controller linearly maps these coordinates to screenshot pixels, without aiming or perception assistance. Actions may combine keys, mouse (left/right/middle), x,y, and ms. A/D move, space jumps, esc toggles inventory, number keys select hotbar slots. Keys/buttons release after every action. Batches contain 1..16 actions and execute without intermediate feedback. Max hold is 2000 ms. Continue until the harness budget ends; do not stop after your first milestone.\nThe game continues running while you think.\nNormal hostile mobs and damage are enabled.\nUse look to observe and act to send actions. Request observations whenever needed.\n",
